  "description": "Fox Orbit: Playful Balloon Bubble Font\nStep into a world of vibrant imagination with Fox Orbit, a playful bubble font family featuring 5 distinct styles. With its ultra-rounded, “inflated” anatomy and glossy highlight details, Fox Orbit captures a nostalgic, Saturday-morning-cartoon energy. Whether you use the classic bubble style or the heart-accented variations, it’s built for high-energy designs that need to pop off the screen.\nBest Used For: Children’s toys packaging, birthday party invitations, candy brand logos, and playful mobile gaming titles.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Fox Orbit: Playful Balloon Bubble Font</p>\n<p>Step into a world of vibrant imagination with Fox Orbit, a playful bubble font family featuring 5 distinct styles. With its ultra-rounded, “inflated” anatomy and glossy highlight details, Fox Orbit captures a nostalgic, Saturday-morning-cartoon energy. Whether you use the classic bubble style or the heart-accented variations, it’s built for high-energy designs that need to pop off the screen.</p>\n<p>Best Used For: Children’s toys packaging, birthday party invitations, candy brand logos, and playful mobile gaming titles.</p>",
